# .lycheeignore — domains excluded from the weekly external link audit.
# Each line is a regular expression matched against the FULL URL (including
# the scheme). Use ^https?:// to anchor a domain. Comments start with #.
# These domains are skipped because they rate-limit, require auth, or sit
# behind SSO / Cloudflare bot protection that produces false positives.

# GitHub raw content endpoints (rate-limited without authentication)
^https?://raw\.githubusercontent\.com

# GitHub REST API (rate-limited; not browsable pages)
^https?://api\.github\.com

# SonarCloud (requires authentication)
^https?://sonarcloud\.io
^https?://.*\.sonarcloud\.io

# SLU portals protected by SSO / Cloudflare bot protection
^https?://.*\.slu\.edu
^https?://slu\.edu
